title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file-manager:toggle
catalog: GUI command
target: file-manager:toggle
summary: File manager: toggle a view flag (root constraint / hidden dot-entries / sort by watch activity / sort by operations written)

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``file-manager`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``ctrl+h`` → ``file-manager:toggle hidden`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``ctrl+r`` → ``file-manager:toggle root`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``ctrl+shift+a`` → ``file-manager:toggle activity`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``ctrl+shift+o`` → ``file-manager:toggle operations`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
